OL,3,GNEWSACouncil unable to confirm when    
OL,4,Astorm-hit leisure centre will reopen   
OL,6,FCouncil bosses have yet to confirm when
OL,7,FHelensburgh Leisure Centre will reopen,
OL,8,Falmost two years after it was closed in
OL,9,Fthe wake of damage sustained during    
OL,10,FStorm Eowyn.                           
OL,12,FThe seaside town's community council   
OL,13,Fexpressed concern at the pace of       
OL,14,Fprogress, despite the fact a recent    
OL,15,Fworks update confirmed that the roof   
OL,16,Frepairs had been completed.            
OL,18,FThe facility has been closed since     
OL,19,Fparts of its roof were ripped off in   
OL,20,FJanuary last year.                     
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
