OL,3,GNEWSACouncil unable to confirm when    
OL,4,Astorm-hit leisure centre will reopen   
OL,6,FA report by Councillor Ross Moreland,  
OL,7,Fthe local authority's policy lead for  
OL,8,Ffinance and commercial services,       
OL,9,Ffeatured photos showing bare walls and 
OL,10,Fother damage inside the centre.        
